 and Upwork bidding.\n\n\n**Formulating Relevant Inquiries**\n\nI'm now focusing on a new set of questions related to M5 chip features and specific user scenarios. I am trying to understand the implications of \"Neural Accelerators,\" the user's specific MacBook configuration, the \"M4 to M5\" performance gains, and how AI/ML advancements apply to the user's workflow as a YouTuber, student, and freelancer.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"A compiled log of all the questions the user asked throughout this session regarding the M3/M4/M5 MacBook configurations, performance comparisons, pricing, and local AI capabilities.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Tera Question History (MacBook M3/M4/M5 Session)\\n\\nPriyanshu, here is the exact list of the questions you asked throughout our session, in chronological order. \\n\\n### 1. The Initial Deep Dive (M3 vs M4 vs M5)\\n> \\\"I want to know the difference between all the MacBook powers: M3, M4, and M5, only. Not Max, not Pro, only the normal M3, M4, and M5 power. Why should I buy M5? Give me reasons, and do precise research and tell me like an expert, not a generic answer for a tech guy.\\\"\\n\\n### 2. Air vs Pro (Neural Accelerators Clarification)\\n> \\\"@[16-core, ~50 TOPS (estimated) + Neural Accelerators in every GPU core] What does this mean? I just want to know for Air. I am buying Air, not Pro, so will there be any differences? Do deep research and tell me if there will be any differences. I will not buy Pro.\\\"\\n\\n### 3. Exact 15-inch Spec Check (India Pricing)\\n> \\\"I have the exact 15-inch, 16 GB unified memory, 512 GB storage, and midnight color, 179,900, like 1,80,000. That is what I have. Which one is it? ARM5 base, Air M5 updated, what?\\\"\\n\\n### 4. Reconciling the $150 GPU Upgrade Confusion\\n> \\\"Now, if I want to update it to air not pro, like now tell me the good news from above, not from here. From M5 Ai