{"step_index":99,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-01T11:08:03Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-01T16:38:03+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-10-01T16:38:16+05:30\nThe search for \"Mac Studio M5 Ultra M5 Max price India 2026 configurations RAM 64GB 128GB 192GB\" returned the following summary:\nThe Mac Studio with M5 Max and M5 Ultra chips was launched in India in August 2026, with availability starting from September 22, 2026.\n\n### **Pricing in India**\n*   **Mac Studio with M5 Max:** Starts at **₹2,79,900** (Education pricing starts at ₹2,56,900).\n*   **Mac Studio with M5 Ultra:** Starts at **₹6,29,900** (Education pricing starts at ₹5,84,900).\n\n---\n\n### **Configurations & Unified Memory (RAM)**\nThe Mac Studio supports different unified memory configurations depending on the chip:\n\n*   **M5 Max Chip:** \n    *   Available with **48GB, 64GB, or 128GB** of unified memory.\n    *   *Note: The 128GB option is typically tied to the higher-end 40-core GPU configuration.*\n*   **M5 Ultra Chip:** \n    *   Supports **256GB** unified memory as standard.\n    *   A **512GB** unified memory option is also offered (available from late October 2026).\n\n### **Key Specifications**\n*   **M5 Max:** Features an 18-core CPU and up to a 40-core GPU.\n*   **M5 Ultra:** Features a 36-core CPU and 80-core GPU (utilizing a quad-die architecture).\n*   **Connectivity:** Both models include Wi-Fi 7, Bluetooth 6, four Thunderbolt 5 ports, HDMI 2.1, and 10Gb Ethernet.\n*   **Design:** Retains the compact, familiar aluminum form factor with improved internal thermals to support the new chip architectures.\n\n*Disclaimer: Prices and availability are based on the official Apple India store launch information as of October 2026. Custom build-to-order configurations may vary in final price.*"}
