{"step_index":102,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-01T11:08:24Z","content":"The Apple store page is mostly JavaScript — not useful for pricing. But I got the key data from searches. Let me get the exact CTO pricing.","tool_calls":[{"name":"search_web","args":{"query":"\"\\\"Mac mini\\\" M6 M5 Pro India price 32GB 48GB 64GB 512GB configure to order ₹ rupees 2026\"","toolAction":"\"Searching CTO pricing\"","toolSummary":"\"Mac Mini CTO India prices\""}},{"name":"search_web","args":{"query":"\"Mac Mini M5 Pro 64GB RAM 512GB price India available configuration 2026\"","toolAction":"\"Searching 64GB config\"","toolSummary":"\"Mac Mini 64GB pricing\""}}]}
{"step_index":103,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-01T11:08:33Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-01T16:38:33+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-10-01T16:38:38+05:30\nThe search for \"\"Mac mini\" M6 M5 Pro India price 32GB 48GB 64GB 512GB configure to order ₹ rupees 2026\" returned the following summary:\nThe Apple **Mac mini** with **M6** and **M5 Pro** chips was officially announced on August 25, 2026, and became available in India on September 22, 2026.\n\n### **Pricing in India**\n*   **Mac mini (M6):** Starts at **₹99,900** (Education pricing starts at ₹88,900).\n*   **Mac mini (M5 Pro):** Starts at **₹2,09,900** (Education pricing starts at ₹1,97,900).\n\n### **Configuration Options**\nThe Mac mini is available for custom configuration through the Apple Store online and in-store. While specific \"Configure-to-Order\" (CTO) pricing for every memory and storage tier varies based on your selection at checkout, here are the general specifications and ranges:\n\n*   **Chip:** Choose between the M6 (12-core CPU, 12-core GPU) and M5 Pro (18-core CPU, 20-core GPU).\n*   **Unified Memory:** \n    *   The **M6** model starts with 16GB and can be configured up to **32GB**.\n    *   The **M5 Pro** model supports higher memory configurations, up to **64GB**.\n*   **Storage:** The lineup supports various storage tiers, typically starting from 512GB and going up to higher capacities depending on the chosen chip and model.\n\n### **How to Customize**\nTo view the exact price for a specific configuration (e.g., M5 Pro with 64GB memory and 512GB or higher storage), you can visit the **[official Apple India Mac mini page](https://www.apple.com/in/shop/buy-mac/mac-mini)**. \n1. Select the base model (M6 or M5 Pro).\n2. Click on \"Select\" to enter the configuration menu.\n3. Choose your preferred Unified Memory and Storage capacity. \n4. The website will automatically update the total price in Rupees (₹) based on your selected options.\n\n*Note: Availability and specific CTO options may vary; it is recommended to check the Apple Store online for the most accurate, real-time pricing for your specific build.*"}
{"step_index":104,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-01T11:08:34Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-01T16:38:34+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-10-01T16:38:42+05:30\nThe search for \"Mac Mini M5 Pro 64GB RAM 512GB price India available configuration 2026\" returned the following summary:\nThe Mac mini with the **M5 Pro** chip was officially released in India on **September 22, 2026**[1][2].\n\n### Configuration and Availability\nThe Mac mini M5 Pro is a \"configure-to-order\" (CTO) device, meaning you can customize its memory and storage at the time of purchase[3]. \n*   **Default Configuration:** The base M5 Pro model typically starts with a 15-core CPU, 16-core GPU, 24GB of unified memory, and 512GB of SSD storage[4][5][6].\n*   **Customization:** You can configure the M5 Pro model with up to **64GB of unified memory** and storage options ranging up to 8TB[7][8][6].\n\n### Pricing in India\n*   **Starting Price:** The Mac mini M5 Pro starts at **₹2,09,900**[9][2][5].\n*   **Custom Configurations:** Upgrading the memory to 64GB will increase the total cost above the base price[7][10]. Because Apple’s pricing for custom configurations varies based on the specific memory and storage tiers selected, you should check the final price on the [official Apple India website](https://www.apple.com/in/mac-mini/) by selecting the **64GB RAM** option in the configuration menu[11][12].\n\nYou can purchase the device through the Apple India online store, the Apple Store app, or authorized Apple resellers like Unicorn and major electronics retailers[13][5][14].\n\nSources:\n[1] [cashify.in](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG1jHTN_voJSpsbjb9Qn1pTTyT8d6fNztRHI0Hooyb43uK8GfTPKbkSk8wZ2qThE5nUyEiDU2rfuIolSxWzTFDruV7lF4CEK08Tiptwj9S6HaA1-HuuIoVCIsdU3UajHEiX9zF7wjNvPeyLsmRuwVLXfXM707BPM8nPc8U=)\n[2] [cashify.in](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG1jHTN_voJSpsbjb9Qn1pTTyT8d6fNztRHI0Hooyb43u