{"step_index":108,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-01T11:09:01Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-01T16:39:01+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-10-01T16:39:07+05:30\nThe search for \"Apple Mac Mini M5 Pro 48GB 512GB price Mac Mini M6 32GB 512GB price USD configuration\" returned the following summary:\nAs of October 2026, the updated Mac mini is available with the **M6** chip or the **M5 Pro** chip[1][2]. Pricing and configuration details for the models you requested are provided below.\n\n### **Pricing and Configuration (USD)**\n\nBecause Apple uses a \"configure-to-order\" model, prices for specific memory (RAM) and storage upgrades are added to the base price of the respective chip models[3][4].\n\n*   **Mac mini with M6 Chip**\n    *   **Base Price:** Starts at **$899**[5][1][2].\n    *   **Configuration (32GB / 512GB):** Upgrading from the base 16GB memory to 32GB typically adds $400 to the price[3]. With the base 512GB storage included, a configured M6 Mac mini with 32GB RAM and 512GB SSD is approximately **$1,500**[3].\n\n*   **Mac mini with M5 Pro Chip**\n    *   **Base Price:** Starts at **$1,699**[5][1].\n    *   **Configuration (48GB / 512GB):** The M5 Pro models support higher memory tiers[3][5]. Based on Apple’s upgrade pricing (where 48GB memory is a $600 upgrade over the base)[3], a configuration with 48GB of memory and 512GB of storage generally prices out around **$2,300**. (Note: Retailers like B&H have occasionally listed specific configurations like the 15-core M5 Pro with 24GB RAM at discounted prices around $1,669)[6].\n\n### **Summary of Differences**\n| Feature | Mac mini (M6) | Mac mini (M5 Pro) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Target Use** | Everyday tasks, AI agents, home server[3][7] | Demanding creative work, video/game dev[1][8] |\n| **Max Memory** | Up to 32GB[8] | Up to 64GB[7][8] |\n| **Starting Price** | $899[1][2] | $1,699[1] |\n\n*Disclaimer: Prices can fluctuate based on ongoing promotions, regional tax