{"step_index":109,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-01T11:09:02Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-01T16:39:02+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-10-01T16:39:12+05:30\nThe search for \"Mac Studio M5 Max price India starting ₹ 2026 Mac Studio M5 Ultra configurations\" returned the following summary:\nThe **Mac Studio** featuring the **M5 Max** and **M5 Ultra** chips was officially released in India in September 2026[1][2][3].\n\n### Pricing in India\n*   **Mac Studio (M5 Max):** Starts at **₹2,79,900**[1][4].\n*   **Mac Studio (M5 Ultra):** Starts at **₹6,29,900**[1].\n\n### M5 Ultra Configurations\nThe M5 Ultra is Apple's high-end, quad-die chip designed for professional workloads[5][6]. Key configuration highlights include:\n*   **CPU:** Up to 36-core CPU (12 super cores and 24 performance cores)[7].\n*   **GPU:** Up to 80-core GPU, featuring Neural Accelerators in every core[8][7].\n*   **Unified Memory:** Supports up to **512GB** of unified memory with a bandwidth of 1.2TB/s[3][7].\n*   **Media Engine:** Features twice the video encode and decode blocks of the M5 Max, supporting up to 33 streams of 8K ProRes 422 video[7].\n*   **Connectivity:** Includes support for Wi-Fi 7 and Bluetooth 6[5].\n\nBoth models are available through the Apple India website, the Apple Store app, and authorized resellers[2][3]. Given the high cost of custom configurations (with some high-end setups exceeding ₹10–15 lakh depending on memory and storage upgrades), it is recommended to select your specifications carefully at the time of purchase, as the internal components are soldered and not user-upgradeable[9][10][5].\n\nSources:\n[1] [business-standard.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHplmHgRH7C2nurDqpLWiojjukNS3YnHbIkkXDiuNvc5eG14Ov4LtxazRsbspxW1wqEfFyILbzwfY0RgXQLroSYGLxhELfuJIHA7Wppnd-DtBNJ5HsPW-moRYirMAOzfKE1cKA3bls5Bu4RSP2YslILbIBZ8wauyeidanbvjaWS_WDgENVWoNDLDW9YVxlElWvpku7_GXP2UiyHQbR7Y-yCVI7h8REpWNp_cOohTAQKuje